#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Dolphin"
msgstr "Dolphin"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:11
msgid "Manage your files"
msgstr "Fayllaringizni boşqaring"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:13
msgid ""
"Dolphin is KDE's file manager that lets you navigate and browse the contents o"
"f your hard drives, USB sticks, SD cards, and more. Creating, moving, or delet"
"ing files and folders is simple and fast."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin — bu qattiq disklar, USB fleşkalar, SD kartalar va boşqa vositalar tar"
"kibini köriş imkonini beruvçi KDE fayl boşqaruvçisi. Fayllar va jildlarni yara"
"tiş, köçiriş yoki öçiriş oson hamda tez bajariladi."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:14
msgid ""
"Dolphin contains plenty of productivity features that will save you time. The "
"multiple tabs and split view features allow navigating multiple folders at the"
" same time, and you can easily drag and drop files between views to move or co"
"py them. Dolphin's right-click menu provides with many quick actions that let "
"you compress, share, and duplicate files, among many other things. You can als"
"o add your own custom actions."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin vaqtingizni tejaydigan köplab qulayliklarni öz içiga olgan. Bir neçta "
"içki varaqlar (tab) va oynani bölib köriş funksiyalari bir vaqtning özida bir "
"neçta jildlar böyiça harakatlaniş imkonini beradi hamda siz fayllarni nusxalaş"
" yoki köçiriş uçun sudrab ötirişingiz mumkin. Siçqonçaning öng tugma menyusi f"
"ayllarni siqiş, ulaşiş, nusxalaş kabi tezkor amallarni taqdim etadi. Şuningdek"
", öz amallaringizni ham qöşişingiz mumkin."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Dolphin is very lightweight, but at the same time, you can adapt it to your sp"
"ecific needs. This means that you can carry out your file management exactly t"
"he way you want to. Dolphin supports three different view modes: a classic gri"
"d view of all the files, a more detailed view, and a tree view. You can also c"
"onfigure most of Dolphin's behavior."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin juda yengil işlaydi, ammo şu bilan birga uni ehtiyojlaringizga moslab "
"olişingiz mumkin. Bu esa fayllarni özingiz xohlagandek boşqarişingizni anglata"
"di. Dolphin uç xil köriniş rejimini qöllab-quvvatlaydi: klassik katakçali köri"
"niş, batafsil jadval körinişi va daraxtsimon köriniş."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:16
msgid ""
"Dolphin can display files and folders from many Internet cloud services and ot"
"her remote machines as if they were right there on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Dolphin internetdagi bulut xizmatlari va boşqa masofaviy kompyuterlardagi fayl"
"larni xuddi öz kompyuteringizdadek körsata oladi."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.dolphin.appdata.xml:17
msgid ""
"Dolphin also comes with an integrated terminal that allows you to run commands"
" on the current folder. You can extend the capabilities of Dolphin even furthe"
"r with powerful plugins to adapt it to your workflow. You can use the git inte"
"gration plugin to interact with git repositories, or the Nextcloud plugin to s"
"ynchronize your files online, and much more."
msgstr ""
"Şuningdek, Dolphin joriy jildda buyruqlarni bajariş imkonini beruvçi örnatilga"
"n terminalga ega. Git plaginlari orqali repozitoriylar bilan işlaş yoki Nextcl"
"oud plagini orqali fayllarni onlayn sinxronlaş imkoniyatlari mavjud."

